! lsrmdltr-isr-mixed-counts with 200 particles and ELEGANT_GPU_LSRMDLTR_DRAW_BYTES=801600 (from suite.json), so the
! table of random numbers holds about 50 particles' worth: four batches, each starting where the last one's
! numbers ended and guessing from its counts, and tables refilled when a guess runs short.
Q1: QUAD, L=0.1, K1=0.5
D: DRIF, L=0.2
LM: LSRMDLTR, L=0.5, PERIODS=10, BU=0.1, N_STEPS=3000, ACCURACY=1e-6, FIELD_EXPANSION="exact", &
    SYNCH_RAD=1, ISR=1, LASER_PEAK_POWER=0
BL: LINE=(Q1, D, LM, D)
